---
title: Commands
pageSlug: commands
mod: adventure-engine
section: config
order: 4
---

- `/adventure site` — plaque for the site you are standing in
- `/adventure site accept` / `leave`
- `/adventure reload` — overlay (op)
- `/adventure cooldown` — delete the nearby site so it can roll again (op)
- `/adventure cooldown all` — this dimension (op)
- `/adventure debug event` — test event on you (op)

WIP features (not finished): world events, adventure bosses, adventure modifiers, party system, procedural campaign generator, structure worldgen rules.
